Reading guide: D is the OLS aspect-drift slope (HWHM estimator,
same as the 07-30 battery). K1-R1: strict two-scale power law
needs |D| < 1 and then forces w = 1/(1-|D|). A CI wholly at or
above 1 refuses the two-exponent picture for that run; a CI
wholly below 1 with w-prediction far from banked w=1 is the W3
tension instead. All UNGRADED; S6 caveat applies (short spans
sit inside the transient; D inherits that limitation).
